  "contract": [
    "Tenant namespace is applied to content paths before candidate extraction, fingerprint, occurrence and index location computation. Diagnostic-only paths retain their existing safe labels.",
    "Product and transport prefixes distinguish typed logical URIs from real HTTP browse/page URLs. Local label delimiters are percent-escaped.",
    "Jira history paths include event IDs. Missing event/comment IDs mark the ledger incomplete and block baseline writes without discarding text.",
    "Legacy unkeyed/keyed baseline fingerprints remain readable but do not suppress new qualified paths. A fresh complete scan can write a new baseline; no baseline, existing index data or key is rewritten automatically.",
    "Same raw value retains common secret_id/index value ID; tenant contexts and origins get different occurrence and location IDs."
  ],
  "scope": "Owned loopback Cloud-shaped APIs, local private keys and SQLite only. No real tenant, external provider, deployment or remote publication exercised."
